--- !u!114 &1374529395
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1374529394}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 171606ef0b8b5f447aea07f1f3ba9608, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  levelNumber: 2
  bannerTitle: JUGAAD WALA GARAGE
  bannerSubtitle: Garage ka har kaam... jugaad se!
  bannerSubtitleEn: Every job in this garage... done with jugaad!
  endHeader: LEVEL 2 PURA!
  endHeaderEn: LEVEL 2 COMPLETE!
  plannedTaskCount: 12
  steps:
  - title: Garage mein andhera hai - roshni karo
    hint: Bulb fuse hai. Phone mein torch hota hai na? B dabake phone nikalo, phir
      TRIGGER dabao.
    doneText: Roshni ho gayi!
    hintImmediately: 1
    hintDelay: 0
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: It's dark in here - get some light
    hintEn: The bulb is fused. Your phone has a torch! Press B to take it out, then
      press TRIGGER.
    doneTextEn: Let there be light!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529396}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Shelf ke saamne oil phaila hai - raasta banao
    hint: Oil pe pair rakha to phisal jaoge. Darwaze ke paas ek bora pada hai - usse
      oil pe bichha do!
    doneText: Ab nahi phisloge!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 45
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Oil spilled in front of the shelf - make it safe
    hintEn: Step on the oil and you'll slip. There's a jute sack by the door - spread
      it over the oil!
    doneTextEn: No more slipping!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529399}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Shutter kholo - handle toota hai
    hint: Handle ka sirf thooth bacha hai. Workbench pe plass pada hai - usse thooth
      pakdo aur upar kheencho!
    doneText: Shutter khul gaya!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 45
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Open the shutter - its handle is broken
    hintEn: Only a stub of the handle is left. Grab the pliers from the workbench,
      clamp the stub and pull up!
    doneTextEn: The shutter's open!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529398}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Upar shelf pe auzaaron ka jhola - neeche girao
    hint: Haath nahi pahunchta? Jhaadu uthao aur jhole ko SIDE se dhakka do - shelf
      ke kinaare se khisak ke neeche gir jaayega!
    doneText: Jhola mil gaya!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 45
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Tool bag on the top shelf - knock it down
    hintEn: Can't reach? Grab the broom and shove the bag SIDEWAYS - it'll slide
      off the end of the shelf!
    doneTextEn: Got the tool bag!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529400}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Pipe se paani tapak raha hai - battery bachao!
    hint: Tap-tap suno! Leak wale joint pe jhole wali polythene lapeto, phir rassi
      le jaake joint pe chhod do - kas ke bandh jaayegi. Battery neeche se hata doge
      to bonus!
    doneText: Leak band! Battery sukhi hai.
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 50
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Water dripping from the pipe - save the battery!
    hintEn: Follow the tap-tap! Wrap the polythene from the bag round the leaking
      joint, then bring the rope to it and let go - it ties itself tight. Move the
      battery out from under it for a bonus!
    doneTextEn: Leak sealed! Battery's dry.
    condition: {fileID: 1374529401}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Ab gaadi start karo!
    hint: Driver ke darwaze ke paas A dabao - andar baith jaoge. Phir chaabi pakdo
      aur kalai ghumao (ya TRIGGER dabao).
    doneText: Gaadi start hi nahi hui...
    hintImmediately: 1
    hintDelay: 0
    basePoints: 500
    titleEn: Now start the car!
    hintEn: Press A at the driver's door to get in. Then grab the key and twist your
      wrist (or press TRIGGER).
    doneTextEn: The car won't even start...
    condition: {fileID: 1374529403}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Battery lagao - pipe ke paas rakhi hai
    hint: Bonnet ka aagla kinaara pakad ke upar uthao. Phir pipe ke paas wali battery
      uthao aur engine mein uski jagah (ghost dikhega) pe chhod do.
    doneText: Battery lag gayi!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 45
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Put the battery in - it's by the pipe
    hintEn: Grab the front edge of the bonnet and lift it. Then bring the battery
      from by the pipe and let go of it in its place in the engine (a ghost shows
      where).
    doneTextEn: Battery's in!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529402}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Battery lag gayi - ab gaadi start karo!
    hint: Driver ke darwaze pe A dabake andar baitho aur chaabi ghumao. Is baar gaadi
      chalu hogi - dashboard pe nazar rakhna!
    doneText: Gaadi chalu! Par... tyre puncture?!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 30
    basePoints: 500
    titleEn: Battery's in - now start the car!
    hintEn: Press A at the driver's door to get in, then turn the key. It'll start
      this time - keep an eye on the dashboard!
    doneTextEn: Engine's running! But... a flat tyre?!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529404}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Puncture! Jack lagao, gaadi uthao
    hint: A dabake bahar niklo. Jack (peeche kone mein) puncture wale tyre ke paas
      ghost pe rakho. Knob pakad ke gol-gol CLOCKWISE ghumao.
    doneText: Gaadi upar! Tyre hawa mein.
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 40
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: Flat tyre! Jack the car up
    hintEn: Get out (A). Put the jack (back corner) on the ghost by the flat tyre.
      Grab the knob and wind it CLOCKWISE.
    doneTextEn: Car's up! The wheel's off the ground.
    condition: {fileID: 1374529407}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Nut kholo aur tyre nikalo
    hint: Spanner (gire hue jhole ke paas) nut pe lagao, ANTICLOCKWISE ghumao. Saare
      6 nut ke baad tyre seedha kheencho.
    doneText: Puncture wala tyre bahar!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 60
    basePoints: 1500
    titleEn: Undo the nuts, pull the wheel off
    hintEn: Put the spanner (by the fallen bag) on a nut and turn ANTICLOCKWISE.
      After all 6, pull the tyre straight out.
    doneTextEn: The flat's off!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529406}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Stepney lagao, gaadi neeche karo
    hint: Peeche kone se achha tyre hub pe ghost pe chhodo. Spanner se nut CLOCKWISE
      tight karo, phir jack ulta ghumao.
    doneText: Stepney lag gayi! Ab nikalne ka time!
    hintImmediately: 0
    hintDelay: 60
    basePoints: 1500
    titleEn: Fit the spare, lower the car
    hintEn: Bring a good tyre (back corner) to the hub ghost. Tighten the nuts CLOCKWISE,
      then wind the jack back.
    doneTextEn: Spare's on! Time to go!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529405}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  - title: Sab ready - gaadi garage se bahar nikalo!
    hint: Jack bahar nikaalo, gaadi mein baitho (A), chaabi ghumao. LEFT trigger
      se chalao, peele box mein roko.
    doneText: Shaadi ke liye taiyaar!
    hintImmediately: 1
    hintDelay: 60
    basePoints: 1000
    titleEn: All set - drive the car out of the garage!
    hintEn: Pull the jack out, get in (A), turn the key. LEFT trigger drives - stop
      in the yellow box.
    doneTextEn: Ready for the wedding!
    condition: {fileID: 1374529409}
    onStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    onComplete:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
  pointsLostPerSecond: 5
  minPoints: 200
  hintPenalty: 0.2
  masterScore: 9000
  goodScore: 6500
  introDelay: 2
  introDuration: 4.5
  pauseBetweenTasks: 2.5
  hud: {fileID: 1480917182}
  introCall: {fileID: 760178919}
  phoneScreen: {fileID: 760178918}
